    "description": "Under a joint project between Chile and Spain, submarine and surface surveys\nwere conducted, in the Cape Shirreff area, to search for the Spanish vessel San\nTelmo.  The San Telmo was lost  in September 1819 and its remains were reported\nby English sealers in the Shirreff area around 1820-1. Nothing has been found.",
